### Login and get JWT
POST http://localhost:5000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get all items (with token)
GET http://localhost:5000/items
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzQ1MjIxMTk5fQ.gbVDABKXkQCdwU9dR2KQMKeYSljfhQkOcHk4L3xMuLY

